<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 04:47:06 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>退役的 KC-10 延长油轮可能会在北非神秘运营商的帮助下获得第二次生命</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/retired-kc-10-extender-tankers-could-get-a-second-life-with-north-african-mystery-operator</link><description>&lt;p&gt;美国空军想知道如何为一名未透露姓名的运营商重新生产四架 KC-10，有几个可能的嫌疑人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/retired-kc-10-extender-tankers-could-get-a-second-life-with-north-african-mystery-operator"&gt;退役的 KC-10 延长油轮可以通过北非神秘操作员获得第二次生命后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:58:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/retired-kc-10-extender-tankers-could-get-a-second-life-with-north-african-mystery-operator</guid></item><item><title>亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰回国时，其岛屿上层建筑布满杀伤痕迹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/uss-abraham-lincoln-comes-home-with-its-island-superstructure-covered-in-kill-marks</link><description>&lt;p&gt;无人机和舰艇杀伤痕迹直观地体现了林肯航母打击群在与伊朗的战斗中所扮演的角色。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/uss-abraham-lincoln-comes-home-with-its-island-superstructure-covered-in-kill-marks"&gt;亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰返航后，其岛屿上层建筑布满杀伤痕迹，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:49:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/uss-abraham-lincoln-comes-home-with-its-island-superstructure-covered-in-kill-marks</guid></item><item><title>美国推动 F-35 葡萄牙考虑更换 F-16</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/u-s-makes-f-35-push-as-portugal-weighs-f-16-replacement</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在里斯本权衡其下一代战斗机的成本、能力和战略影响之际，美国的竞标面临着欧洲竞争对手。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/u-s-makes-f-35-push-as-portugal-weighs-f-16-replacement"&gt;美国推动 F-35 葡萄牙考虑更换 F-16 的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:14:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/u-s-makes-f-35-push-as-portugal-weighs-f-16-replacement</guid></item><item><title>海军加倍开发 X-BAT 垂直起降“战斗机”无人机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/navy-doubles-down-on-x-bat-vtol-fighter-drone-development</link><description>&lt;p&gt;X-BAT 飞行测试即将到来，并且已经公布了达到作战能力的极其雄心勃勃的时间表。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/navy-doubles-down-on-x-bat-vtol-fighter-drone-development"&gt;海军加倍投入 X-BAT 垂直起降“战斗机”无人机开发后的&lt;/a&gt;文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 18:26:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/navy-doubles-down-on-x-bat-vtol-fighter-drone-development</guid></item><item><title>西科斯基的“黑鹰 2070”战略包括无人机、新发动机以及今年的无人驾驶 U-Hawk</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sponsored-content/sikorskys-black-hawk-2070-strategy-includes-drones-new-engines-and-flying-the-pilotless-u-hawk-this-year</link><description>&lt;p&gt;品牌内容：计划中的 UH-60 升级套件包括无人驾驶的 U-Hawk、新发动机、更大的射程、发射效果和扩大的自主性。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sponsored-content/sikorskys-black-hawk-2070-strategy-includes-drones-new-engines-and-flying-the-pilotless-u-hawk-this-year"&gt;西科斯基公司的“黑鹰 2070”战略包括无人机、新发动机和今年无人驾驶的 U-Hawk&lt;/a&gt;文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:41:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sponsored-content/sikorskys-black-hawk-2070-strategy-includes-drones-new-engines-and-flying-the-pilotless-u-hawk-this-year</guid></item><item><title>黑胡子高超音速导弹从地面发射器发射</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/blackbeard-hypersonic-missile-shown-being-fired-from-ground-launcher</link><description>&lt;p&gt;黑胡子是陆军推动高超音速武器机动性更强、价格更便宜的努力的一部分。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/blackbeard-hypersonic-missile-shown-being-fired-from-ground-launcher"&gt;黑胡子高超音速导弹从地面发射器发射的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:32:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/blackbeard-hypersonic-missile-shown-being-fired-from-ground-launcher</guid></item><item><title>F-47 飞行测试的基础如何奠定</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/how-the-groundwork-for-f-47-flight-testing-is-being-laid</link><description>&lt;p&gt;空军测试中心计划在 F-47 开始飞行后使用不断发展的现实世界和数字测试相结合的方法。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/how-the-groundwork-for-f-47-flight-testing-is-being-laid"&gt;F-47 飞行测试的基础工作如何奠定的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 20:22:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/how-the-groundwork-for-f-47-flight-testing-is-being-laid</guid></item><item><title>英国突击队在北约大型演习中从德国潜艇中出现</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/british-commandos-emerge-from-german-submarine-during-major-nato-exercise</link><description>&lt;p&gt;英国15年来最大规模的突击队演习正在为北大西洋和高北地区的潜在突发事件做准备。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/british-commandos-emerge-from-german-submarine-during-major-nato-exercise"&gt;英国突击队在北约大型演习期间从德国潜艇中出现的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 20:13:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/british-commandos-emerge-from-german-submarine-during-major-nato-exercise</guid></item><item><title>B-1B 突然从英国空军基地撤退凸显了对飞机掩体投资的明显缺乏</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/glaring-lack-of-investment-in-aircraft-shelters-highlighted-by-b-1bs-sudden-retreat-from-u-k-airbase</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在这一点上，美国空军如果投资将其宝贵的资产暴露在航线物理掩护上以免受无人机攻击，可能会带来一场灾难。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/glaring-lack-of-investment-in-aircraft-shelters-highlighted-by-b-1bs-sudden-retreat-from-u-k-airbase"&gt;B-1B 从英国空军基地突然撤退凸显了飞机掩体明显缺乏投资的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 18:09:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/glaring-lack-of-investment-in-aircraft-shelters-highlighted-by-b-1bs-sudden-retreat-from-u-k-airbase</guid></item><item><title>NASA 的 SR-71 Blackbird 能否改装至 4 马赫？</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/could-nasas-sr-71-blackbird-be-modified-to-reach-mach-4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;SR-71 的机身能够超越其已知的最高速度，NASA 可能有充分的理由通过新发动机突破其极限。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/could-nasas-sr-71-blackbird-be-modified-to-reach-mach-4"&gt;NASA 的 SR-71 Blackbird 能否改装以达到 4 马赫？&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 17:56:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/could-nasas-sr-71-blackbird-be-modified-to-reach-mach-4</guid></item></channel></rss>